    <string name="home_setup_message">Deco Launcher is your Home app: %1$s\nHome button override: %2$s\n\nTo make the Home button open Deco Launcher, do one of these:\n\n1. Turn on the override: Accessibility → Deco Launcher Home button. Google TV stays installed and may flash for a moment.\n\n2. Or disable Google TV over adb (faster, frees memory):\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.google.android.tungsten.setupwraith\nTo undo, run them with \"enable\" instead of \"disable-user\".</string>
